  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen and sustain political and electoral citizens engagement to build a stable democracy and support an open society in DR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This program aims to improve the political, electoral, and civic engagement of Congolese women, men, girls, and boys through education programs. Project activities will target the Congolese population in general and women, youth, and other excluded and marginalized groups.</narrative>
  </description>
